<ttl id="1002P_S0005_748MK_T00E0" variety="T00E0">
<name>Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</name>
<para id="RM000000P9R00JX" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="630X0-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000P9R00JX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000P9R00JX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000C0E00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the center position. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFE009X_02_0046"/>)</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the spiral cable under the following conditions.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141931J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>After setting the spiral cable to the center position, measure the resistance at the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise and at the position turned 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and measure the resistance while turning it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A7(DISP) - C3(DISP)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A8(EAU) - C4(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A5(IL+2) - C12(IL+2)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not turn the spiral cable 2.5 or more turns left or right from the center position, as it may break.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
